  "body": "I'm having the exact same problem with the same device as described here: https://github.com/node-hid/node-hid/issues/197\r\n\r\nAt the end of that issue it mentions that it may be resolved with the latest release of that project. There was only 1 related PR for it, linked to this issue: https://github.com/node-hid/node-hid/issues/348\r\n\r\nSpecifically they note \"The hidapi updates that allow Macs to see devices with multiple usages as unique items has been added to node-hid as of version v1.1.0.\"\r\n\r\nThe specific commit that seems to fix the issue is here: https://github.com/libusb/hidapi/compare/083223e77952e1ef57e6b77796536a3359c1b2a3...ca1a2d6efae8d372587f4c13f60632916681d408#diff-5cbb2d1918d13a205b0b45fa24166f42\r\n\r\nI'm wondering if the same issue could be what is affecting WebHID? ",
